 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:23Z (RFD66606-2312) 'pseudo-version passes; a seven-digit hash, a local-time stamp, a `v1.0.0`
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:24Z (RFD66606-2312) 'core, a padded calendar date and a stage-suffixed date each fail by name;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

