 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:26Z (RFD66606-2312) 'accepts a seven-digit hash, so the 12-digit rule is this check's, not
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:27Z (RFD66606-2312) 'Go's. Go does hold a pseudo-version to its commit's time and hash, which is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

