 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:38Z (RFD66606-2312) '2. The stage is a pointer. A moving tag per stage (`dev`, `beta`, `rc`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:39Z (RFD66606-2312) '   `release`) names the build that stage holds. Promotion moves the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:40Z (RFD66606-2312) '   pointer to the same commit; nothing is rebuilt or renamed. The GitHub
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:41Z (RFD66606-2312) '   pre-release flag follows the pointer.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:42Z (RFD66606-2312) '3. One release record per repository, and every other format derived from
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:43Z (RFD66606-2312) '   it. The Godot engine already works this way: `version.py` holds major,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:44Z (RFD66606-2312) '   minor, patch and status; the build adds the commit hash and committer
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:45Z (RFD66606-2312) '   timestamp from git; the Windows resource takes `FILEVERSION` from the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:46Z (RFD66606-2312) '   numbers; the Android build turns the status into a digit of
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-2312) '   `versionCode` (dev 1, alpha 2, beta 3). Here the record is the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:48Z (RFD66606-2312) '   repository's `CITATION.cff` (operator, 2026-10-12), in two halves. The
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:49Z (RFD66606-2312) '   committed file holds what does not change per build: title, authors,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:50Z (RFD66606-2312) '   licence, the interface versions. A commit cannot carry its own hash, so
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:51Z (RFD66606-2312) '   the release step writes the per-build half into the copy that ships
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:52Z (RFD66606-2312) '   with the artifact: `version` is the tag, `commit` the full hash,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:53Z (RFD66606-2312) '   `date-released` the UTC date. CFF 1.2.0 admits no other top-level key;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:54Z (RFD66606-2312) '   a `status` key fails its schema. The stage, the derived forms and the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:55Z (RFD66606-2312) '   artifact digests ride as `identifiers` of type `other`: `stage:dev`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:56Z (RFD66606-2312) '   `windows:YYYY.MMDD.hhmm.0`, `android:<versionCode>`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:57Z (RFD66606-2312) '   `pep440:0.0.0.devYYYYMMDDhhmmss`, `sha256:<digest>`. A sample of that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:58Z (RFD66606-2312) '   shape validates against the CFF 1.2.0 JSON schema. The check recomputes
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:01:59Z (RFD66606-2312) '   every derived value from the `commit` field.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:02:00Z (RFD66606-2312) '4. Compatibility rides on the interface that breaks: a protocol, ABI or
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:02:01Z (RFD66606-2312) '   save-format version that moves only when that interface does, as Go
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:02:02Z (RFD66606-2312) '   moves a module path to `/v2`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-12T00:02:03Z (RFD66606-2312) '5. A signed attestation binds the record to the artifact's digest.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
 Text:Written

